      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Reflex anuria is described, and various etiologic theories are presented. A case report of documented reflex anuria is presented. Both ureterorenal pain-induced reflex and neurovascular reflex may produce suppression of urine output from an otherwise normal kidney."},
